 ## 2. Edit the textures

-Edit any PNG in place with whatever editor you like. At pack time Retro compares every file's hash against the manifest and **stages only the ones you changed**. You never trim the folder down by hand, and unedited files cost nothing.
+Edit any PNG in place with whatever editor you like. At pack time neoretro compares every file's hash against the manifest and **stages only the ones you changed**. You never trim the folder down by hand, and unedited files cost nothing.

